Subject: [PATCH v2 3/5] kbuild/extable: Hook up sortextable into the build system.
Date: Thu, 19 Apr 2012 14:59:57 -0700
Message-Id: <1334872799-14589-4-git-send-email-ddaney.cavm@gmail.com>
